WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.758 --> 00:00:09.008
<v Hazel>Hazel: Smell that? Home. Mostly.</v>

2
00:00:09.717 --> 00:00:14.917
<v Ember>Ember: That's Verdalis, the Bloom Wyrm.
She's been asleep in there for years.</v>

3
00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:18.225
<v Clover>Clover: She's not sleeping. She's hurting.</v>

4
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:21.813
<v Hazel>Hazel: Thornsprouts. And raptors. Lots of
raptors.</v>

5
00:00:22.342 --> 00:00:24.792
<v Rowan>Rowan: Stay close, everyone. And mind the
thorns!</v>

